sentences.text:
Resultantly, without meaning any expression of opinion on the merits of the case and in view of law laid down in Maulana's case (supra) and on the basis of parity of petitioners with the co-accused, it is ordered that the petitioners be released on regular bail subject to furnishing requisite bail bonds/surety bonds to the satisfaction of the trial Court concerned on the following conditions:-
1. they will appear before the Court on each and every date of hearing;
2. they will not give any threat or intimidation to the prosecution witnesses;
3. they will not indulge in any criminal activity.

